let mut s=String::from("# G2 joint-ring stream and tree census\n\nThe fixed joint-ring recipe retains its structural saving when replaying the borrowed queue policy and actual reduction-tree topology. On primary, generic affine pairs fall **632,442→572,574**, and modeled projective mixed additions plus finish joins fall **1,178→676**. This permits a private native correctness/resource implementation. **No native measurement or adoption is selected by these counts.** Production and accepted proof timings are unchanged.\n\nThis extends the [passed work screen](../2026-11-06-g2-joint-ring-screen176/README.md), preserving radix128, nineteen windows and two original input parts. The recoder is inherited without rerunning its tests. Counts assume nonidentity, noncancelling ordinary sums; actual equal-x/cancellation, field instruction cost, cache/scheduler behavior and RAM remain unqualified. Raw2×2 is not its admitted grouped runtime.\n\n|Query|Original stream pairs|Ring stream pairs|Original top pairs|Ring top pairs|Original merge/weighted pairs|Ring merge/axis/weighted pairs|Original projective mixed + finish|Ring projective mixed + finish|\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n");
